<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Basic IDOR - EliteHackLab</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css"></head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav"><div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a><a href="/labs/idor"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i> IDOR Labs</a></div></nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header"><h1>🔓 Basic IDOR - Message Access</h1><div class="lab-info"><span class="lab-tag difficulty-easy">Easy</span><span class="lab-tag points"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> 10 pts</span></div></div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>You are user #2 (john). You should only see your own messages. But the API doesn't check ownership - try accessing other users' private messages by changing the ID.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-terminal"></i> Message API</h2>
      <div class="vulnerable-form">
        <label>Message ID (you own message #4):</label>
        <input type="number" id="msgId" value="4" min="1" max="10" autocomplete="off">
        <button onclick="getMessage()" class="btn">Get Message</button>
      </div>
      <div id="msgResult" class="result-box" style="margin-top:1rem;"></div>
      <div class="code-block">API: GET /labs/idor/basic/message/{id}

Your message: ID 4
Try: ID 1, 2, 3, 5 (other users' private messages)
Look for messages marked is_private: 1 from admin!</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flag-submit">
      <h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('idor-basic','flagInput_idor','flagResult_idor'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;"><input type="text" id="flagInput_idor" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off"><button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button></form>
      <div id="flagResult_idor" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  <script>
    async function getMessage() {
      const id = document.getElementById('msgId').value;
      const res = await fetch(`/labs/idor/basic/message/${id}`);
      document.getElementById('msgResult').innerHTML = '<pre>'+JSON.stringify(await res.json(),null,2)+'</pre>';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
